CORE
main.c
--unwind 2 --rounds 2 --allow-pointer-unsoundness --no-por --thread-symmetry exact
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^thread symmetry: 1 pair of 2 threads$
--
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
Main joins only the second thread. A join that finds it exited and the first
one not tells the two apart, so the ordering yields there and the bug stays.
